{
 "id": "strum",
 "order": 6,
 "name": "Strum for CHORD and Vlvt",
 "description": [
  "On CHORD and Vlvt tracks: FUNC + SHAPE = strum time (OFF = all notes together, 2..250 ms, then note values /64 .. 1/1",
  "in tempo); FUNC + COLOR = strum pattern: UP, DOWN, RND (new order on every trig), 1324, 1423, 4132, 4231,",
  "ROOT (lowest note, then the other three together), TOP (highest note first).",
  "Per track, saved with the sound, p-lockable, LFO and velocity destination. Every chord note gets its own envelope",
  "from its strum onset: attack (FUNC + DECAY), hold while GATE, decay (DECAY)."
 ],
